A||||19||fieroman_5000||Do the 4-cyl internal parts fit into an SD block?||||5||
Z||000000||fieroman_5000||11-09-2001||05:04 PM||||I was wondering cause I can get a block for real cheap  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> and I don't wan't to buy the SD head it costs $900+ so can i use the stock crank and head???<P>Thanx alot!<P>Fieroman <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||5
